Restore device-aware USA Flash prompts, following actual input and configured mappings.

Reuses Tobiichi-Port's GPL-3.0 Flash recognizer removed in a25331d. Adds
last-active input routing, remapped Sony labels, bounded guest-frame batches,
and fail-open guest drawing. No performance claim; see the research report.

